        "TileImage": "$($repository eb55abf5-7989-4fda-873a-8a9f835a0be6).Image",
        "Description": "Our client has tracked down the sound engineers, responsible for intercepting his comms and indirectly killing his second in command. Without the intel we will not be able to decrypt the messages and pinpoint the location of other conspirators, who are presumably working with the terrorist organization run by Sean Rose.  The contract is straight forward and precise. Eliminate these pawns and send a message.\r\rHappy hunting 47.\r\rBest of luck",
